====Ambush!====
In the middle of the woods, you come across a researcher from [[Devon Corporation]], a tech company based in [[Rustboro City]]. After explaining that he is looking for a {{p|Shroomish}}, he is suddenly confronted by a member of [[Team Magma]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Team Aqua]]{{sup/3|S}}. The Grunt had planned to ambush the worker and steal important documents when he left the woods, but grew too impatient for that. Defeat him in battle and he flees the scene, but not before hinting that his friends are up to something in Rustboro. The grateful researcher gives you a [[Great Ball]] as thanks. He then rushes off to Rustboro after realizing what his attacker wanted.

