===Gabby and Ty===
North of the [[Winstrate family|Winstrate]] house, the path narrows into a deep ravine with many rocks strewn about. Use {{m|Rock Smash}} to clear a way forward and reach the dirt road. It is here that you find [[Gabby and Ty]], the reporter and cameraman team that you met back in [[Slateport City]]. Accept their challenge to demonstrate your battle prowess, and they will ask for an interview afterwards. Find a [[TV]] at a later point for a chance to hear about yourself on the news!

